  "title": "Braised Short Ribs",
  "description": "Chef John's sherry braised short ribs are a foolproof addition to your dinner menu. This easy recipe yields tender, restaurant-quality beef ribs at home.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2014-04-08T19:39:06-04:00",
